1
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,920
{\an8}<i>[female judge] The defendant will stand.</i>

2
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:15,920
<i>Trevor Bingley, on all</i>
<i>14 counts of dangerous driving…</i>

3
