<i>before you're taken down?</i>

14
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:47,160
<i>[sincerely] I'm just really, really sorry.</i>

15
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:53,920
<i>-You see… there was this bee</i>
<i>-[inviting music begins]</i>

16
