{\an8}<i>the scuba divers on the fronts.</i>

22
00:01:19,320 --> 00:01:21,560
{\an8}<i>Forget the espadrilles, where's Orlando?</i>

23
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:24,080
{\an8}<i>Orlando isn't coming.</i>
<i>They're sending someone else.</i>

24
