<i>Good. Go away.</i>

31
00:01:39,880 --> 00:01:41,520
<i>Hello?</i>

32
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:42,680
<i>Oh, hello.</i>

33
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:46,440
<i>[upbeat] </i><span style="style2">I'm Trevor. From, uh,</i>
<span style="style2">from Housesitters Deluxe.</i>

34
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:51,360
<i>I'm house-sitting for you this week.</i>

35
00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:52,360
<i>-Oh.</i>
<span style="style1">-[buzzing]</i>

36
