<i>[sighs] I found them,</i>
<i>in a drawer with the flip-flops.</i>

53
00:03:06,880 --> 00:03:09,520
<i>-Is this him?</i>
<i>-Good morning, Sir. Pleased to meet you--</i>

54
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:10,480
