<i>and I need to be quick.</i>

56
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:13,400
<i>Okay.</i>

57
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:15,680
<i>Everything you need to</i>
<i>know is written in this manual.</i>

58
00:03:15,760 --> 00:03:17,320
<i>-Manual. Right. Good.</i>
<i>-[tentative music]</i>

59
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:19,000
