74
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,160
<i>Uh, no, that's fine.</i>

75
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:55,160
<i>-[Nina] Okay, bye.</i>
<i>-The dog has a severe nut allergy.</i>

76
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:57,840
