<i>-[Cupcake barks]</i>
<i>-Oh.</i>

80
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:04,480
<i>[door clicks]</i>

81
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:07,160
<i>-So please keep the door closed.</i>
<i>-Door closed. Right.</i>

82
00:04:07,760 --> 00:04:10,280
<i>And the chip in her collar</i>
<i>operates the dog flap in there.</i>

83
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:11,520
