<i>-[soft muttering]</i>
<i>-[alarm beeps]</i>

108
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:18,200
<i>1748.</i>

109
00:05:18,280 --> 00:05:20,520
<i>-Yup. So, okay, there we go.</i>
<i>-Okay.</i>

110
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:21,720
<i>[door opens]</i>

111
00:05:22,320 --> 00:05:23,360
<i>Okay.</i>

112
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:27,480
<i>And to arm the system, even easier,</i>
<i>uh, it's the Battle of Bulhornbører.</i>

113
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:29,440
<i>-[soft muttering]</i>
<i>-[Nina] 1513.</i>

114
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:32,480
<i>Oh… right, yes.</i>
<i>I think perhaps I should uh--</i>

115
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:33,800
<i>Oh no, don't worry.</i>
<i>It's all in the manual.</i>

116
00:05:33,880 --> 00:05:35,600
<i>Oh, the manual. Yes, of course.</i>

117
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:37,920
<i>Yeah, if the panel locks down</i>
<i>for any reason,</i>

118
