<i>Took me a little longer</i>
<i>than I was hoping, to be honest.</i>

165
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:20,320
<i>But you know what this means…</i>

166
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:23,520
<i>It means that we can</i>
<i>still go on holiday together.</i>

167
00:08:24,200 --> 00:08:25,640
