176
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:53,760
<i>[buzzing]</i>

177
00:08:55,680 --> 00:08:56,920
<i>Glue.</i>

178
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:58,520
<i>Glue, glue, glue,</i>
<i>glue, glue, glue, glue, glue.</i>

179
00:09:15,680 --> 00:09:19,000
<i>-[soft muttering]</i>
<i>-[tense music builds]</i>

180
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:21,560
<i>Manual.</i>

181
00:09:21,640 --> 00:09:23,360
<i>The manual.</i>

182
00:09:24,040 --> 00:09:24,880
<i>Come on.</i>

183
00:09:30,160 --> 00:09:32,200
<i>-[door clicks]</i>
